    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d738">

                <pb facs="0751" n="745" xml:id="pg745"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.48/2049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in Sweden
                        (Johnson)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-03-03T20:00:00-04:00">March 3, 1942—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>121. The Department’s approval of the plans to which you refer for the relief of
                    Greece has been made known to the British Government. You are consequently
                    requested to associate yourself with the British Minister in the necessary
                    discussions with the Swedish Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
